## Bandit Level 5 → Level 6

**Challenge:** 
The password for the next level is stored in a file somewhere under the inhere directory and has all of the following properties:

human-readable
1033 bytes in size
not executable

**Solution:**
bandit5@bandit:~$ find -readable  -size 1033c ! -executable -exec cat {} \;
HWasnPhtq9AVKe0dmk45nxy20cvUa6EG


**Explanation:**
Use the find command and add the properties you want it to search for.
find -readable will filter human readable files
- size 1033c files that are exaclt 1033 bytes in size
! -executable using the ! in front will find file NOT executable.

